  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Ok, yes, if we want this to support _stochastic_ rounding as well then things get really messy. Even more so if we want to be able to go through the fastpath of NVIDIA's `.rs` PTX instructions (since their semantics is dubious and not really well documented).\n\nHowever, at this stage I was just proposing to enable the other \"standard\" rounding modes:\n<img width=\"1122\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f92b2ea-99be-4c47-9b6e-5f50446f9bab\" />",
    "created_at": "2026-03-20T09:42:56Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/175409#issuecomment-4096879065",
